# land.sh's speed-gate baseline (PERF's format): one line PER GREEN
# LANDING, appended, never edited in place — the newest line is the
# comparison a later landing's speed gate reads.
#
#   <main-sha> <instructions-retired> <maxrss-bytes> <reason-or-dash>
#
# `reason` is that landing's AVRA_LAND_SPEED_OK, when the gate needed
# one to pass; a dash otherwise.
